# AudioWRT-owned binary package|OpenWrt SDK make target
#
# This file maps AudioWRT package names to their SDK source-tree make targets.
# Packages are package-only by default and are compiled with NO_DEPS=1 so their
# OpenWrt runtime dependencies remain official release binaries. Packages listed
# separately in config/build/source-build-packages genuinely compile/link upstream
# source and may traverse the SDK build dependency graph when selected.

